{
  "id": "33729_nugeru",
  "headword": "{脱|ぬ}げる",
  "reading": "ぬげる",
  "romaji": "nugeru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to come off (shoes, clothes)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to come off; to slip off (shoes, clothes, a hat)",
      "explanation": "For something one is wearing to come off by itself, without one taking it off. Also the potential \"can take off\"."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "33729_nugeru_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{靴|くつ}→靴：00725_kutsu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{脱|ぬ}げた。",
      "english": "My shoe came off.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33729_nugeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{風|かぜ}→風：00641_kaze⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{帽子|ぼうし}→帽子：00692_boushi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{脱|ぬ}げそうになった。",
      "english": "My hat nearly blew off in the wind.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33729_nugeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{走|はし}っている→走る：00519_hashiru⟧⟦{途中|とちゅう}→途中：01684_tochuu⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦サンダル→サンダル：01365_sandaru⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{脱|ぬ}げて、⟦{転|ころ}んで→転ぶ：00863_korobu⟧しまった。",
      "english": "My sandal came off while I was running, and I fell over.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n- ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧: {脱|ぬ}げる (to come off)\n- ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧: ⟦{脱|ぬ}ぐ→脱ぐ：00518_nugu⟧ (to take off)\nUse ⟦{脱|ぬ}ぐ→脱ぐ：00518_nugu⟧ when someone takes the item off on purpose: ⟦{靴|くつ}を{脱|ぬ}ぐ→靴を脱ぐ：23571_kutsuwonugu⟧. Use {脱|ぬ}げる when it slips off: ⟦{靴|くつ}→靴：00725_kutsu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{脱|ぬ}げる.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{靴|くつ}→靴：00725_kutsu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{脱|ぬ}げる: a shoe comes off\n- ⟦{帽子|ぼうし}→帽子：00692_boushi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{脱|ぬ}げる: a hat comes off\n- {脱|ぬ}げやすい: easy to slip off\n- {脱|ぬ}げにくい: hard to get off (a tight boot)\n\nWATCH OUT:\nThe same form is also the potential of ⟦{脱|ぬ}ぐ→脱ぐ：00518_nugu⟧: ⟦この→この：00962_kono⟧⟦ブーツ→ブーツ：04529_buutsu⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{一人|ひとり}→一人：00630_hitori⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{脱|ぬ}げない (I can't get these boots off by myself).",
